## Remote Work Requirements

### Home Office Setup

| Requirement | Standard |
|-------------|----------|
| Internet | Minimum 50 Mbps |
| Workspace | Dedicated, private area |
| Equipment | Company laptop, monitors provided |
| Ergonomics | Proper desk/chair (allowance available) |
| Security | Locked when not in use |

### Equipment Allowance

| Item | Allowance |
|------|-----------|
| One-time setup | $500 |
| Annual refresh | $150 |
| Monitor | Company provided |
| Headset | Company provided |
| Keyboard/mouse | Company provided |

### Technology Requirements

| Requirement | Implementation |
|-------------|----------------|
| VPN | Required for all access |
| MFA | Required for login |
| Encryption | Full disk encryption |
| Updates | Auto-update enabled |
| Antivirus | Company-provided EDR |

