## Security Requirements

### Remote Work Security

| Requirement | Implementation |
|-------------|----------------|
| Network | VPN required |
| Authentication | MFA always |
| Physical | Screen lock, clean desk |
| Public Wi-Fi | Not permitted for work |
| Printing | Minimize, secure disposal |
| Visitors | No work visible |

### Data Handling

| Data Type | Remote Handling |
|-----------|-----------------|
| Public | No restrictions |
| Internal | Standard precautions |
| Confidential | VPN only, no printing |
| Restricted | Not permitted remotely |

